CASE pinned edit: Alpha, Gamma lost; Beta survives on its second reader PASS
CASE both readers of Beta drift: Beta joins; header line grammar PASS
CASE unpinned / stale-only / new path: 0 headings, exit 0, classes named PASS
CASE --strict: unpinned tracked path exits 2 PASS
CASE SKILL.md without a section: exit 2 FORECAST_UNPRICED, forecast still printed PASS
CASE SKILL.md + section: that heading voided by its own sha, exit 0 PASS
CASE --skill-lines resolves to the covering section PASS
CASE unknown section heading: exit 2 SKILL_SECTION_NOT_FOUND PASS
CASE the ledger file itself is a direct read nobody pins: exit 2 PASS
CASE direct-read path that an entry also pins is priced (Epsilon), exit 0 PASS
CASE veto-eligible failing entry: Delta is already uncovered, never counted as lost PASS
CASE --diff-to: a.txt drift + edited Gamma section priced together PASS
CASE option-like rev: exit 64 PASS
CASE non-canonical path: exit 64 PASS
CASE unresolvable rev: exit 2 PASS
CASE set-but-unusable TMPDIR: exit 2, never a silent /tmp fallback PASS
FORECAST_SELFTEST: 16/16 pass
